      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Filter Execution Order: Filters execute strictly in sequential order (1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4 -> 5).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "c307577d",
